{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-syntomic-characterize}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-composition-type-P}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-composition-syntomic}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7ebb68cee1b3886684c02e2973ddba6bfa89a78734efa59a52bd05ff2093bbab", "source_text": "In the proof of Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe saw that being syntomic is a local property of ring maps.\nHence the first statement of the lemma follows from\nLemma <REF_0002> combined\nwith the fact that being syntomic is a property of ring maps that is\nstable under composition, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d05475ef1389750e297c3d2bd55780d11a974c5ef31423d1a1ae4b398e3a0461", "unit_id": "tag:01UH:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-syntomic}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:562dcf77c00ac2067f5c2339ba0ea10d158fb0f40ae7ef42bbdf20f0360dfa08", "source_text": "The base change of a morphism which is syntomic is syntomic.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d5e58fb8e3c751be891f61f89c4b9544113e06ba61d311348366772e09944f9b", "unit_id": "tag:01UI:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-syntomic-characterize}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-composition-type-P}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-base-change-syntomic}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:243c9f3ec073929fb8455e6bb354374d8a474a00e8229fc4fbd81ba5af37d4c9", "source_text": "In the proof of Lemma <REF_0001>\nwe saw that being syntomic is a local property of ring maps.\nHence the lemma follows from\nLemma <REF_0002> combined\nwith the fact that being syntomic is a property of ring maps that is\nstable under base change, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d4454c776d8d52bd5d92dd65e1893596eab6bcb553d6c824e4c3de910c880841", "unit_id": "tag:01UI:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-open-immersion-syntomic}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:43402f5a29273ab493249a9b9e434912804bec1ab733c546d6ee256a2f725447", "source_text": "Any open immersion is syntomic.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:515e33fb07c079bee1ec14ae23ef41c1e2c545890172be44fe8b7e82511f4668", "unit_id": "tag:01UJ:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a4ae1397643ed46115eafdab19f6da269d997917f4e1573b4f25b954498d116f", "source_text": "This is true because an open immersion is a local isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:acb4ec29b81aa746a58aa6944bf2eb44b4cbbc3550be451946e31155b346a9c6", "unit_id": "tag:01UJ:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-syntomic-locally-finite-presentation}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ed5d6e990b566a9062587332658dfacf4def367458a908c4d507bc20e29c3a6d", "source_text": "A syntomic morphism is locally of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5500725fe7c5bede429755d81148587bbd6f7e79a7ae97f4902036586e4f5a1c", "unit_id": "tag:01UK:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a4ae1397643ed46115eafdab19f6da269d997917f4e1573b4f25b954498d116f", "source_text": "True because a syntomic ring map is of finite presentation by\ndefinition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:853c5f5f1c7cb923ed3d583f361164e7c34a7f5ef5dac8bf7f557b57ecb632de", "unit_id": "tag:01UK:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-syntomic-flat}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b5104fcd4a9dc0521822889eef68ca1903eb34e2595a3d38c36a6dffa00b378f", "source_text": "A syntomic morphism is flat.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e4c837523da7554db0d37dd511766f900f47b318fb9ce04e2f37e6d79076fda1", "unit_id": "tag:01UL:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01UB", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a4ae1397643ed46115eafdab19f6da269d997917f4e1573b4f25b954498d116f", "source_text": "True because a syntomic ring map is flat by definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8a3f8ea061492785f7038a87cc279722a3c0c1607da0fbdc33333792ceb4756d", "unit_id": "tag:01UL:proof"}
